sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(Claude/Cursor)
    participant MCP as FastMCP Server
    participant Auth as Auth Provider
    participant Tools as Tool Layer
    participant Services as Services
    participant DB as Supabase

    Agent->>MCP: Connect (MCP Protocol)
    MCP->>Agent: Tool Discovery<br/>(5 consolidated tools)

    Agent->>MCP: workspace_operation<br/>(set_context, project_id)
    MCP->>Auth: Validate Token
    Auth-->>MCP: User Context
    MCP->>Tools: Set Workspace Context
    Tools-->>MCP: Context Set
    MCP-->>Agent: Success + Context

    Agent->>MCP: entity_operation<br/>(create, document, data)
    MCP->>Tools: Process Entity Op
    Note over Tools: Auto-inject project_id<br/>from workspace context
    Tools->>Services: Create Entity
    Services->>DB: INSERT with RLS
    DB-->>Services: Created Entity
    Services-->>Tools: Entity Data
    Tools-->>MCP: Markdown Response
    MCP-->>Agent: Success + Entity

    Agent->>MCP: data_query<br/>(rag_search, content)
    MCP->>Tools: Process Query
    Tools->>Services: Hybrid Search
    Services->>DB: FTS + Vector Search
    DB-->>Services: Results
    Services-->>Tools: Ranked Results
    Tools-->>MCP: Markdown Response
    MCP-->>Agent: Search Results

    Agent->>MCP: relationship_operation<br/>(link, source, target)
    MCP->>Tools: Process Relationship
    Tools->>Services: Create Link
    Services->>DB: INSERT relationship
    DB-->>Services: Created
    Services-->>Tools: Relationship Data
    Tools-->>MCP: Markdown Response
    MCP-->>Agent: Link Created
